Hi,

There was a message in comp.sys.dec a while back about the power supply in the
XL boxes. It senses whether the main fan turns so the cpu can be kept cooled.
If the fan in the front of the box doesn't turn, no power will be delivered to
the cpu. Check the wiring to the fan, or otherwise check out the fan. (ie was
it noisy or whatever..) Post a message to comp.sys.dec if possible. A fellow
there carries parts for the XL boxes based on the Intel pentium & maybe the
parts are interchangeable.

HTH.

