This sounds very much like it doesn't find a keyboard.
It then assumes it is connected to a serial terminal via com1 and
directs all output there and expects all input from there.
(Since it is not using the video card, you get a blue background.
"Yes, I'm switched on, but I'm not doing anything here.")

If you manage to direct the output to the screen, you should get a
clearer idea on how to proceed.

